This is an explicit no-adoption boundary, not permission to choose an unnamed dependency later.

Any implementation that needs a new third-party dependency is outside this approved candidate contract.

The location choice remains D-NEST-SOCKETIO1. Its import alias in this example follows optional-package option A only for readability. The public member names, arguments, return carriers, error cases and lifecycle above are the API choice, regardless of the separately selected location. No placement choice silently approves this API.

